WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.060
I was at the archaeology museum with my mom when she dragged me over the Do Not Touch rope.

00:04.400 --> 00:05.080
This is a T-Rex.

00:05.400 --> 00:08.840
She slapped its leg and a small crack formed on its leg where I was standing.

00:09.060 --> 00:12.500
If that crack spread, the entire skeleton would come down and crush us.

00:12.680 --> 00:13.840
Mom, the bone cracked.

00:14.080 --> 00:16.520
I pointed at it, but she rolled her eyes without looking.

00:16.680 --> 00:18.840
T-Rex bones were five times thicker than ours.

00:19.040 --> 00:20.360
You couldn't break one if you tried.

00:20.600 --> 00:22.020
She slapped it again without looking.

00:22.180 --> 00:24.760
And the crack got larger, my body filling with dread.

00:25.020 --> 00:26.240
A security guard walked over.

00:26.440 --> 00:27.800
Ma'am, step back behind the rope.

00:28.000 --> 00:29.500
You're not authorized to touch any of this.

00:29.500 --> 00:30.200
It's delicate.

00:30.500 --> 00:32.060
Mom rolled her eyes and stepped back.

00:32.240 --> 00:35.260
But the second he was gone, she grinned and dragged me back over the rope.

00:35.820 --> 00:36.600
Stupid security guard.

00:36.740 --> 00:37.560
He doesn't know anything.

00:37.760 --> 00:38.980
These things survived asteroids.

00:39.400 --> 00:40.620
She shook the bone with excitement.

00:40.960 --> 00:43.220
Her eyes wild as she turned to keep lecturing me.

00:43.340 --> 00:46.280
But bone dust had started falling from the crack because of her shaking.

00:46.480 --> 00:49.680
So I pressed my hands together over the bone, trying to hold it in place.

00:49.880 --> 00:53.200
But she grabbed my arm off it so hard I felt the whole thing wobble.

00:53.440 --> 00:54.720
Why are you not listening to me?

00:54.820 --> 00:56.720
I'm explaining how strong their bones were.

00:56.880 --> 00:58.000
Because there's a crack in them.

00:58.140 --> 00:58.820
I took her arm.

00:58.820 --> 01:00.160
It's about to fall on us.

01:00.320 --> 01:00.780
Let's go.

01:01.060 --> 01:03.060
She ripped free and threw her head back screaming.

01:03.440 --> 01:04.240
You stupid kid.

01:04.480 --> 01:05.460
This is a T-Rex skeleton.

01:05.800 --> 01:06.400
It can't break.

01:06.580 --> 01:09.240
I don't care what you or that stupid security guard has to say.

01:09.420 --> 01:11.180
She punched the leg hard without looking.

01:11.260 --> 01:12.160
Then crossed her arms.

01:12.400 --> 01:12.800
There, see?

01:13.040 --> 01:13.420
It's fine.

01:13.640 --> 01:14.780
But then the whole leg snapped.

01:15.060 --> 01:17.000
My face fell as I jumped back over the rope.

01:17.340 --> 01:21.340
Mom finally looked up and screamed right as 500 pounds of bone fell on top of her.

01:21.460 --> 01:23.380
She lay there with her head in the T-Rex's mouth.

01:23.620 --> 01:24.040
Not moving.

01:24.280 --> 01:26.140
That's when the security guard stormed over.

01:26.320 --> 01:27.400
You're banned from the museum.

